    riscv: Add RVV wide-character string/memory kernels with multiarch wiring
    
    New e32 RVV kernels for the wcs* and wmem* family (wcschr, wmemchr,
    wcslen, wcsrchr, wcsspn, wcscmp, wcsncmp, wmemcmp, wcschrnul, wcscspn,
    wcspbrk) with per-character membership/diff/NUL masks resolved by
    vfirst.m/vredmaxu, wired into the riscv multiarch ifunc machinery
    (impl list, non-SHARED redirect, Makefile).

